00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:54.260
one example here would
be these bubble charts.

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:56.030
So let's say bubble
charts are always great

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:58.660
when you have three number
dimensions that you wanna have

00:07:58.660 --> 00:07:59.640
in one chart.

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:01.820
So here the X axis has the marketing spend

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:03.710
