00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.740
And I think you can very
well see the correlation.

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:07.850
You could now also insert a trend line

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:10.430
if you would want to really
make that more salient.

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:12.965
But then also you see in
the size of the bubbles,

00:08:12.965 --> 00:08:17.080
that the areas of these bubbles
represent the volume sold.

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:18.590
And the other thing,
it's also pretty clear

00:08:18.590 --> 00:08:20.710
there doesn't seem to
be a clear correlation

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:22.567
